{"author":{"id":"038d65070aa747b6bc9d50939fa697ec871a40ed259db54429b255bbef2581d6"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792715267,"nonce":"hYD1qbOCmt4RkyATL7Umslyf+RA=","title":"Show public author avatars and full commit hover cards","message":"Expanded history and diff views should identify commit authors with provider avatars when the repository remote matches a known provider and the account is available through a public API. Hovering commits should show the full local commit message, author name and avatar.\n\nImplement bounded background public lookups for GitHub, GitLab and Bitbucket Cloud, scoped decoded images, and offline initials fallback. Show graph-row and selected-commit avatars plus diff author headers. Read full messages lazily on hover, use modeless scrollable cards, ignore stale responses and release UI resources on close. Validate provider matching, public response adapters, request coalescing, cancellation, cache bounds and graph/diff UI in both themes.","files":null}]}